<title>JAMAICA: CRICKET-JAMAICA 245-5 AT END OF FIRST DAY AGAINST INDIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-JAMAICA 245-5 AT END OF FIRST DAY AGAINST INDIA.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jamaica, after being put into bat, were 245-5 in their first innings at the end of play on the first day of their four-day match against India on Friday.</p>
</text>
